{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日一昨日と仕事の前に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"インターハイのバスケを観に船橋アリーナに行ったの！ヽ(≧▽≦)/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たまたま高校の時の監督と会って一緒に試合観たんだ〜！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"北海道の恩師と東京の教え子が千葉船橋でたまたま再会って、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すごい確率だよね(@_@)！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがたや〜！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おかげでとっても見やすい席で見れた！(*'-')"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は仕事で、決勝戦行けなかった...めっちゃ観たかった...(T^T)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"監督と、もっとバスケをメジャーにするために頑張りますって約束したんだ(｀_´)ゞ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして福岡大濠、優勝おめでとうございます！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大濠の試合は２試合観れたけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"堅実な努力を重ねてるのをすごく感じて、応援したくなるチームだった(>_<)！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなすごくてたくさん感想はあるんだけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"特に13番の選手すごかったなぁ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"周りを鼓舞するし、決めてほしいとこで絶対に決めるし"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"流れを作れる人だよね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ああいう人がいるのは強いよなあ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと前橋育英の９番の選手もすごかったー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"脚すごいね！ディフェンスも頑張るしガンガン切り込んでいくし、魅せるバスケって感じだった！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あーやっぱり高校バスケアツいなー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ウインターカップも見に行きたいなっ(。・_・。)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"出場した皆さん、お疲れさまでした！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなとっても輝いてたー(^-^)！！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみに今はお仕事中(｀_´)ゞ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もうすぐよばれるー！行ってきます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/nanami.hashimoto/img/0000-222.jpeg","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}